WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.624 --> 00:00:03.374
(metal clanging)

00:00:06.207 --> 00:00:10.374
- I'm a fighter, because that's
all I've known how to be.

00:00:13.536 --> 00:00:14.778
My name is Tanya Smith

00:00:14.778 --> 00:00:18.366
and I'm a competitive historical fencer.

00:00:18.366 --> 00:00:21.705
We train in a system developed
by a 14th century master

00:00:21.705 --> 00:00:24.590
and practiced until the 16th century.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:26.872
We've built a really
awesome community of women

00:00:26.872 --> 00:00:29.807
and we're all doing it together.

00:00:29.807 --> 00:00:33.010
(hard rock music)

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:37.519
I train and teach in long
sword, it's my primary weapon.

00:00:37.519 --> 00:00:42.023
I'm 5'2" and my long sword
comes up to shoulder level.

00:00:42.023 --> 00:00:44.639
It's empowering and fun.

00:00:44.639 --> 00:00:47.384
You can use it to cut,
you can use it to thrust,

00:00:47.384 --> 00:00:50.551
you can get close in range and grapple

00:00:51.434 --> 00:00:53.934
and really just kick ass with.

00:00:58.457 --> 00:01:01.426
Classes were very, very
small in the beginning.

00:01:01.426 --> 00:01:04.347
It felt like I was the only woman.

00:01:04.347 --> 00:01:06.593
And being the token girl

00:01:06.593 --> 00:01:10.002
it was something I was
comfortable with at first,

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:11.451
but as I got better

00:01:11.451 --> 00:01:14.636
and as I started developing
my goals as a fighter,

00:01:14.636 --> 00:01:17.562
I realized I wanted to have a community

00:01:17.562 --> 00:01:20.895
of other women with shared philosophies.

00:01:23.106 --> 00:01:26.426
An event I planned was
a women's tournament,

00:01:26.426 --> 00:01:29.759
one of the first of its kind in the U.S.

00:01:33.966 --> 00:01:37.466
People will view a women's event as lesser

00:01:38.428 --> 00:01:40.260
but I shouldn't have to beat someone

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.028
who's double my height or double my weight

00:01:42.028 --> 00:01:44.307
to prove that I'm a good fencer.

00:01:44.307 --> 00:01:48.390
The standard should be
beating the best fighters.

00:01:53.192 --> 00:01:57.360
Women make good fighters
because they want to be there.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:00.610
They put their heart and souls into it.

00:02:02.599 --> 00:02:05.896
You don't do this because
you're forced to be there.

00:02:05.896 --> 00:02:06.729
You don't do this

00:02:06.729 --> 00:02:09.392
because there's an
expectation to be there.

00:02:09.392 --> 00:02:13.309
They do it because they're
passionate about it.

